+# Requirement accountability
+
+| Requirement | Outcome / location | Actual verification and remaining limit |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Continue a specific original-record lead | Official six-page2610370MFR acquired/read; SOURCES.json | Current public catalogue exposed the actual file; no guessed asset or gated route. This is a released scan, not native authoring/audio. |
+| Compare with held records | COMPARISON-PINS.json, MFR01–09 | Full new MFR visual reading plus reused prior18page note reading; selected document comparison, not audio/clock test. |
+| Preserve conflicts, source links and values | README and each pin | Recording labels, warnings present/absent, log/day/time uncertainty, capability/participation and readiness values retained; no controlling value/cause selected. |
+| Preserve originals and prior versions | Both source hashes unchanged | MFR is a different actual file/extent. It does not replace notes or resolve assembly/source lineage. |
+| Carry missing inputs as TODOs | OPEN-TODOS.json | MC-T07partiallyadvanced, not closed; MFR-T01–03added; all18originalcriteria and technical ownership retained. |
+| Test assumptions and disconfirmation | README and pin limits | Summary scope, source dependence, possible completed correction, ordinary reconstruction and missing orders retained; no deception/intent/absence inference. |
+| Exact revision diff; layout separate | TEXT-CHANGES.diff, EDITORIAL-REVISION.diff; PAGE-READING.json/SOURCE-CHECKS.json | Real Git addition diff from absent prior paths; six whole-page views separate from render/fingerprint success. |
+| Account for acquisition failure | SOURCES.json; native failed script/receipt and correction diff | Null Content-Type preserved; stopped before body; one corrective fetch validates actual PDF. Own guard correction is not historical evidence. |
+| Public AveLyra commit and push | Separate native plan/receipts after review | Exact account/repository/author+committer/ref/all-file checks required before success claim. No main merge, private push or history rewrite. |
+| Overview coordination | Separate local handoff after verified publication | Only authorized verified Overview destination; delivery is not acceptance/integration. |
